  "title": "July 23, 2026 KPN Webinar Recording Now LIVE",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>?️ Trang Nguyen presented on \"Rare-variant association studies: a primer, a problem, and a proposal for baseline masks.\"</p><p>? Topics covered:</p><ul style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">A brief primer on rare-variant association studies (RVAS)</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">A widespread problem regarding \"masks\" in RVAS</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">A proposal for baseline masks to increase consistency and replicability in future studies</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">? Explore Trang's paper before the talk: https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-026-02597-9</p><p>? The webinar recording is now LIVE, watch here: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/FiheGHamfkM\">https://youtu.be/FiheGHamfkM</a></p><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/July%2023%2C%202026%20KPN%20Webinar.png\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"2a30f84f-c43e-4d97-9196-8a251023f431\" alt=\"\"></p>",
